    {
      "abstract": "The spin-density matrix elements $\\rho_{00}$ with respect to the reaction plane in midcentral $Au+Au$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s_{NN}}=200$ GeV versus $p_{T}$ of the vector meson. The sizes of the statistical uncertainties are indicated by error bars, and the systematic uncertainties by caps. The $K^{\u22170}$ data points have been shifted slightly in $p_{T}$ for clarity. The dashed horizontal line indicates the unpolarized expectation $\\rho_{00}=1/3$. The bands and continuous horizontal lines show predictions discussed in the text.",
